  "description": "Process a begins three nested levels, updating N of rows 1, 2 and 3 at the outer, middle and inner levels. Process b reads rows 1-3 through a new snapshot at each of: all three levels open; after the inner CommitTrans; after a Rollback (of the middle level); after a CommitTrans of the outer level; and after two further calls (CommitTrans, Rollback) with no level open. Process a reads its own view after the Rollback. Asks which changes another process sees at each resolution.",
